  "scope": "# Review \u2014 135219aecdb4\nTask/source: `135219aecdb4`, generator v2.1.0 SHA `e8c1e1883a69ac7a6993afd8a86f7b479aecd1cab446a164b28385450734398a` \u2192 v2.1.1 SHA `9fe9fb320bc4b64d8fa1a0b353311c9eeb322c1514d2c8a7160b2a6055ec5992`.\nDefect \u2192 repair: explicit `n_erased=True`, `1.9`, and `\"3\"` were coerced; they now fail before `gen_ctx` unless the value is an exact integer.\nReference rule changes: none; canonical/base bytes and `RULE_HASH=8036db043882` are unchanged.\nPrototype: proposed episode-level `pass_count \u2208 {1,2,3}`, default `3` exact canonical, selected once per episode.\nEpisode evidence: 2 demonstrations + 4 distinct protected-Racket-labelled queries per setting over six shared true-three-pass inputs.\nFocused checks: task tests 51/51, production lint PASS, production override 990/990 PASS, Racket/Python parity PASS.\nAdversarial checks: 128 unique max-bound inputs; strict numeric rejection and public/private ID separation PASS.\nOptional broad audit: task tests passed, but its semantic census was interrupted and was not rerun.\nTickets: existing audit witness reproduced without clearing it; one lawful gather-index shortcut witness retained for `21ada29469bf`.\nRemaining limit: seed-bounded prototype evidence is proposed only, not production approval or training admission.\nDisposition: routine production bugfix; prototype is ready for maintainer review and replay.",
